{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Small Gap 是一款以溫和熱量赤字協助減脂的 App，透過每日預算、逐餐記錄與體重趨勢，讓使用者不必採取極端節食。它適合希望穩定控制飲食、追蹤運動與體重變化的人士；原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-123.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>溫和減脂與飲食管理</h2>\n<p>App 以每日預算、逐餐記錄與剩餘額度協助控制飲食，並記錄帶氧運動與心率區間，連接 Apple Health 匯入訓練、靜息心率及體重；體重以 7 日平均呈現。內建多個歐洲地區餐點資料，亦可選用 AI 拍照估算，需自備 API 金鑰；沒有金鑰時可從 400 多種食物手動記錄。所有估算僅供參考，並非醫療建議。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-109-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-110-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-111-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-112-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-113-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-114-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Small Gap</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/small-gap/id6821348247?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.575542+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":324,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T15:17:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T13:17:29.479811+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:43.234699+00:00","content_hash":"65d4b38c17582272944ca728b2ae1c9f148b89e9a65b4ab9bd24f23c99c6ee45","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}